---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/content';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Naga Venkata Sai Chennu"
  description="How this site collects, uses, and protects your data."
  canonicalPath="/privacy"
>
  <main class="container prose">
    <p class="back"><a href="/">← Back to site</a></p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="meta">Last updated: 2026</p>

    <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
    <p>
      This site is operated by {site.name} ("I", "me"). For any privacy question or
      request, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>What I collect and why</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Newsletter:</strong> your email address, the time and page you signed
        up from, and a record of your consent (used to send the weekly newsletter you
        asked for). I use double opt-in — no email is added until you confirm.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Contact form:</strong> your name, email, and message, so I can reply.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Analytics:</strong> privacy-friendly, cookieless page metrics and
        aggregate newsletter open/click counts, to understand what's useful.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Security:</strong> IP address and user agent are recorded with
        signups and messages to prevent abuse and evidence consent.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Legal basis</h2>
    <p>
      Newsletter emails are sent on the basis of your <strong>consent</strong>, which
      you can withdraw at any time via the unsubscribe link in every issue. Contact
      replies and abuse prevention rely on legitimate interest.
    </p>

    <h2>Who processes your data (sub-processors)</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Vercel</strong> — hosting and privacy-friendly analytics</li>
      <li><strong>Neon</strong> — database</li>
      <li><strong>Resend</strong> — email delivery</li>
      <li><strong>Anthropic</strong> — drafting newsletter content (no subscriber data is sent)</li>
      <li><strong>Cloudflare Turnstile</strong> — bot/spam protection on forms</li>
      <li><strong>Upstash</strong> — rate limiting</li>
      <li><strong>Google</strong> — sign-in for the private admin area only</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Retention</h2>
    <p>
      I keep subscriber records while you're subscribed and consent evidence for a
      reasonable period afterward. Analytics events and contact messages are pruned
      on a rolling schedule, and stored IP addresses are anonymized after a short
      window. You can request deletion at any time.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      You can access, correct, or delete your data, and object to or restrict its
      processing. To unsubscribe, use the link in any newsletter. For anything else,
      email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> and I'll action it.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      The public site uses no tracking cookies (analytics are cookieless). The admin
      area uses a single strictly-necessary session cookie for sign-in.
    </p>
  </main>

  <style>
    .prose {
      max-width: var(--prose);
      padding-block: var(--sp-8) var(--sp-9);
    }
    .back {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
    }
    .prose h1 {
      margin-block: var(--sp-4) var(--sp-2);
    }
    .prose .meta {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      color: var(--ink-4);
      margin-bottom: var(--sp-6);
    }
    .prose h2 {
      font-size: var(--text-xl);
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      font-weight: var(--fw-semibold);
      margin-block: var(--sp-6) var(--sp-3);
    }
    .prose p {
      margin-block: var(--sp-3);
      color: var(--ink-2);
    }
    .prose ul {
      display: grid;
      gap: var(--sp-2);
      padding-left: var(--sp-5);
      margin-block: var(--sp-3);
    }
    .prose li {
      list-style: disc;
      color: var(--ink-2);
    }
    .prose a {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
